# flashcards: a deck turned on gives new words, review, undo an answer; the date comes from --day
#! day 20755
2 shot start
5 shot decks
DOWN 5 shot deck_on
RSOFT shot start2
5 shot modes
# the session reads the decks that are on once, at its start
#! read 120000
5 shot review
# a card reads only its word's transcription, the first line of its dict.bin article
#! read 200
5 shot answer
5 shot next
0 shot undone
5 5 shot next_again
3 shot next2
RSOFT shot stopped
RSOFT shot menu
